<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Third Italian War of Independence</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1866">1866</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Third Italian War of Independence was fought in 1866 between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-italy">Kingdom of Italy</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austrian-empire">Austrian Empire</a>, alongside the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-prussian-war">Austro-Prussian War</a>. Although <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> was defeated at Custoza on land and at Lissa at sea, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a>'s victory over <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> allowed Italy to gain <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venetia">Venetia</a> under the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-vienna-1864">Treaty of Vienna</a> (1866).</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/third-italian-war-of-independence.jpg" alt="Third Italian War of Independence" width="320" height="182" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Juliusz Kossak · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Custozza1866.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
